WEBVTT

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:25.275
<i>What would you do if you could
have any wish granted?</i>

00:00:26.193 --> 00:00:27.778
<i>"I want to become a singer."</i>

00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:30.489
<i>"I wish for wealth."</i>

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:33.909
<i>"I want to possess eternal life."</i>

00:00:35.244 --> 00:00:37.120
<i>I'm sure there would
be various wishes.</i>

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.250
<i>But, I...</i>

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:47.714
Hey, listen to this!

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:50.092
We've got a transfer student
coming today!

00:00:50.092 --> 00:00:52.678
And I hear she's super cute!

00:00:52.678 --> 00:00:53.637
For real?

00:00:53.929 --> 00:00:56.098
Our class is full of uggos too. Score!

00:00:56.098 --> 00:00:57.724
It's my dream come true!

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:01.311
<i>It's got nothing to do with me.</i>

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:06.650
Hey, we're starting. Take your seats.

00:01:07.693 --> 00:01:10.112
We'll start by introducing the
new transfer student.

00:01:10.487 --> 00:01:11.405
Enter.

00:01:20.455 --> 00:01:23.959
Nice to meet you. I'm Kurenai Rin.

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.548
I hope you'll be kind to me.

00:01:30.716 --> 00:01:31.675
She-

00:01:33.051 --> 00:01:34.261
<i>She's cute...</i>

00:01:43.478 --> 00:01:45.397
Man...

00:01:46.148 --> 00:01:48.900
<i>I can't believe we got
a girl on that level.</i>

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:54.990
<i>I think I might be looking forward
to school tomorrow.</i>

00:01:56.491 --> 00:01:59.703
Hey, excuse me. But could I ask a favor?

00:02:00.912 --> 00:02:04.124
Um, you're in my class, right?

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.376
Huh? Oh...

00:02:08.253 --> 00:02:10.797
You don't remember me?

00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:13.800
<i>There's no way I wouldn't
remember you!</i>

00:02:14.259 --> 00:02:17.012
<i>Did she actually follow me?</i>

00:02:18.013 --> 00:02:19.264
Um...

00:02:19.765 --> 00:02:21.642
Uh, what?

00:02:22.517 --> 00:02:25.562
Yesterday, I moved to the floor above.

00:02:25.562 --> 00:02:27.814
But my key broke,
and I don't know what to do.

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:28.690
Your key?

00:02:29.024 --> 00:02:31.193
I don't have a phone, either...

00:02:34.363 --> 00:02:37.741
Um... Could you call a locksmith for me?

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:39.242
<i>Her key?</i>

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.079
<i>Of course...</i>

00:02:42.537 --> 00:02:44.706
<i>Of course she isn't after me.</i>

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:48.251
Yeah... Sure, hold on a moment.

00:02:50.379 --> 00:02:53.757
<i>Oh well. At least I got a
chance to talk to her.</i>

00:02:54.216 --> 00:02:55.175
Thank you.

00:02:55.592 --> 00:02:57.386
This is a big help.

00:03:02.724 --> 00:03:05.060
Oh, why don't you wait here until
the locksmith comes-

00:03:21.451 --> 00:03:22.619
I love you.

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:23.787
Huh?

00:03:27.416 --> 00:03:28.375
Just kidding!

00:03:35.799 --> 00:03:37.259
Let's hurry over to the school store.

00:03:37.509 --> 00:03:40.470
Ah, we'd better hurry or
we'll miss lunch!

00:03:49.438 --> 00:03:50.564
I'm glad you came!

00:03:51.815 --> 00:03:53.734
Here, your lunch box!

00:03:53.734 --> 00:03:55.318
I made it myself.

00:03:55.861 --> 00:03:58.321
Here, say "ah."

00:03:59.698 --> 00:04:01.450
Ah...

00:04:02.075 --> 00:04:03.535
Is it good?

00:04:03.535 --> 00:04:04.828
Y-Yeah.

00:04:05.454 --> 00:04:07.831
Oh, I'm glad!

00:04:08.582 --> 00:04:11.626
I also made miso soup.

00:04:11.877 --> 00:04:13.336
D-Did you?

00:04:15.505 --> 00:04:17.090
Here, have some.

00:04:18.383 --> 00:04:19.634
What's wrong?

00:04:19.634 --> 00:04:21.344
Oh, uh, was it...

00:04:22.804 --> 00:04:24.347
...always like that over there?

00:04:24.347 --> 00:04:25.348
It wasn't?

00:04:26.558 --> 00:04:30.270
No, I don't... think it's wrong.

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:31.354
You're weird.

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:32.856
I know!

00:04:33.523 --> 00:04:34.858
<i>Hey, Effvkun.</i>

00:04:35.442 --> 00:04:37.486
Do you have any plans after school?

00:04:37.486 --> 00:04:39.488
No, not really.

00:04:40.322 --> 00:04:43.241
Would you like to come
to my place, then?

00:04:43.533 --> 00:04:44.451
Uh...

00:04:44.993 --> 00:04:46.995
You know, right now...

00:04:47.913 --> 00:04:50.957
My parents are away.

00:04:50.957 --> 00:04:51.792
Huh?

00:04:57.631 --> 00:05:00.133
That reminds me,
did you get your key fixed?

00:05:00.675 --> 00:05:02.385
I didn't.

00:05:02.803 --> 00:05:04.095
What're we going to do, then?

00:05:04.971 --> 00:05:07.224
I mean, it was never broken
in the first place.

00:05:07.224 --> 00:05:08.141
Huh?

00:05:08.642 --> 00:05:11.269
Come on. It's open, so come in.

00:05:11.645 --> 00:05:13.063
O-Okay.

00:05:17.234 --> 00:05:18.276
What?!

00:05:19.694 --> 00:05:20.987
What was that?

00:05:23.782 --> 00:05:24.950
What's the matter?

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:27.410
Oh, uh, something just...

00:05:27.661 --> 00:05:32.082
Actually, this happened
once before, didn't it?

00:05:32.082 --> 00:05:33.583
There you go again.

00:05:33.583 --> 00:05:36.920
Didn't we do you-know-what
here just yesterday?

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:39.881
No, it's not that. It's something else.

00:05:40.257 --> 00:05:42.676
Come on, enough about that.

00:05:42.676 --> 00:05:44.511
Let's hurry inside.

00:05:58.525 --> 00:05:59.693
Just kidding!

00:06:04.823 --> 00:06:05.907
Ah, damn it!

00:06:06.658 --> 00:06:10.412
I am Kurenai Rin,
an assassin sent to kill you!

00:06:31.975 --> 00:06:32.809
Huh?!

00:06:34.144 --> 00:06:35.186
What is it?

00:06:35.729 --> 00:06:36.605
Uh...

00:06:37.188 --> 00:06:39.149
I guess I was just dreaming.

00:06:39.149 --> 00:06:40.567
What kind of dream?

00:06:41.192 --> 00:06:42.068
Oh?

00:06:42.569 --> 00:06:44.362
What dream was it?

00:06:44.362 --> 00:06:46.031
You don't remember?

00:06:46.281 --> 00:06:47.490
No...

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:50.452
Well then, I'll help you remember.

00:06:56.875 --> 00:06:58.793
Ah, ow, ow...

00:06:58.793 --> 00:07:00.295
I cut my lip...

00:07:00.712 --> 00:07:02.714
Rin, are you all right?

00:07:03.381 --> 00:07:04.633
Hey, Rin!

00:07:06.676 --> 00:07:08.345
Eiji-sama, don't!

00:07:10.764 --> 00:07:13.099
That will not do.

00:07:14.017 --> 00:07:14.935
Huh?

00:07:16.478 --> 00:07:18.396
Fortune

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:24.986
You wait (matsu) for good fortune,
so you tie those to pine (matsu) trees,

00:07:25.487 --> 00:07:30.909
And you tie bad fortunes to cedar (sugi)
trees so that they will pass (sugiri).

00:07:31.618 --> 00:07:36.748
You got bad luck, so you should tie your
fortune to a branch of the cedar tree.

00:07:36.998 --> 00:07:39.876
Didn't you draw a fortune too?
What was it?

00:07:40.669 --> 00:07:42.671
I got "worst luck."

00:07:44.798 --> 00:07:47.050
Wait lyo, that's a pine tree.

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:48.593
Didn't you get "worst luck"?

00:07:48.593 --> 00:07:51.680
No, this belongs on the pine tree.

00:07:52.555 --> 00:07:53.556
Why?

00:07:55.642 --> 00:07:56.685
Let's see...

00:07:57.102 --> 00:07:59.980
Your prayers will go unanswered,
and the person you await will not come.

00:08:00.313 --> 00:08:03.233
Let go of what you have lost,
and cancel any trips.

00:08:03.233 --> 00:08:04.651
Give up on business ventures,

00:08:04.651 --> 00:08:07.862
yield to opposition,
and focus on your studies.

00:08:08.571 --> 00:08:13.201
Your current romantic partner is the
best you will find. Do not hesitate.

00:08:18.999 --> 00:08:22.210
It belongs on the pine tree, doesn't it?

00:08:22.711 --> 00:08:23.461
Huh?

00:08:39.352 --> 00:08:41.104
You can't touch it!

00:08:41.896 --> 00:08:43.690
Hm? What's wrong?

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:47.986
Are you not feeling well?

00:08:47.986 --> 00:08:49.696
That's not it.

00:08:49.696 --> 00:08:50.613
Just now...

00:08:51.656 --> 00:08:54.117
No, for some time now, something...

00:08:54.659 --> 00:08:57.162
What the? I can't remember.

00:08:57.162 --> 00:08:59.039
Onii-chan!

00:09:18.183 --> 00:09:19.642
Sena...

00:09:22.145 --> 00:09:23.063
Oh?

00:09:24.522 --> 00:09:25.690
Where...

00:09:27.358 --> 00:09:28.401
...am I?

00:09:30.361 --> 00:09:32.155
Sir!

00:09:32.947 --> 00:09:35.408
Have you decided on your order?

00:09:35.408 --> 00:09:36.910
Uh! yes!

00:09:37.243 --> 00:09:38.578
I'm sorry.

00:09:39.037 --> 00:09:40.371
Um...

00:09:45.919 --> 00:09:47.962
What will it be?

00:09:47.962 --> 00:09:50.298
Uh, oh, I know!

00:09:50.548 --> 00:09:54.886
Can I wait until my sister
Sena comes and orders?

00:09:59.015 --> 00:10:01.476
You're always like this, Eiji.

00:10:01.726 --> 00:10:02.477
Huh?

00:10:03.728 --> 00:10:07.357
Honestly, you're endlessly interesting.

00:10:07.857 --> 00:10:08.733
What the?

00:10:11.736 --> 00:10:12.862
Sena...

00:10:13.029 --> 00:10:16.282
<i>Please... Run, Onii-chan.</i>

00:10:16.991 --> 00:10:19.536
<i>I've already given up.</i>

00:10:21.538 --> 00:10:22.872
Onii-chan.

00:10:24.165 --> 00:10:26.543
What are you spacing
out for, Onii-chan?

00:10:27.001 --> 00:10:28.962
Uh, oh, nothing.

00:10:28.962 --> 00:10:33.383
Is Rin-san keeping you from sleeping
every night or something?

00:10:33.383 --> 00:10:34.676
What?!

00:10:34.676 --> 00:10:36.469
L-It's not every night!

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:38.721
E-E-Every night, with my Eiji-sama?!

00:10:38.721 --> 00:10:40.306
E-E-Every night, with my Eiji-sama?!
What was that before?

00:10:40.306 --> 00:10:40.932
E-E-Every night, with my Eiji-sama?!

00:10:40.932 --> 00:10:42.183
E-E-Every night, with my Eiji-sama?!
Sena was...

00:10:42.183 --> 00:10:43.268
Oh, shut up!

00:10:43.268 --> 00:10:43.518
We're dating, so what's the problem?!

00:10:43.518 --> 00:10:47.147
We're <i>dating, so what's the problem?!
No, Sena's right here, perfectly well.</i>

00:10:48.398 --> 00:10:50.150
<i>Sena is well?</i>

00:10:50.692 --> 00:10:53.528
<i>Something about that is strange.</i>

00:10:57.991 --> 00:11:01.286
Next, it's your turn, Eiji.

00:11:03.079 --> 00:11:04.080
What?

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:07.458
Don't tell me...

00:11:08.293 --> 00:11:10.211
...I'm dreaming?

00:11:10.795 --> 00:11:15.717
No, you're in the current you's own world.

00:11:15.717 --> 00:11:17.302
The current me?

00:11:17.969 --> 00:11:20.555
The past you have left behind,

00:11:20.763 --> 00:11:24.559
and the dreams you imagine
are no more than illusions.

00:11:25.435 --> 00:11:31.399
Your past and dreams are merely drawn
out from your current world.

00:11:31.733 --> 00:11:35.695
And finally, this is not
an illusory world,

00:11:35.695 --> 00:11:37.780
but the current you's world.

00:11:39.824 --> 00:11:42.410
Nothing you're saying makes any sense!

00:11:42.827 --> 00:11:44.454
Now, Eiji.

00:11:44.913 --> 00:11:47.916
What does the current you wish for?

00:11:48.583 --> 00:11:50.418
What is your wish?

00:11:51.044 --> 00:11:53.213
The current me's wish?

00:11:54.422 --> 00:11:55.673
Inn:

00:11:56.633 --> 00:11:57.967
Inn:

00:12:23.242 --> 00:12:26.704
<i>What would you do if you could
have any wish granted?</i>

00:12:27.705 --> 00:12:29.207
<i>"I want to become a singer."</i>

00:12:30.208 --> 00:12:31.751
<i>"I wish for wealth."</i>

00:12:33.294 --> 00:12:35.421
<i>"I want to possess eternal life."</i>

00:12:36.714 --> 00:12:38.633
<i>I'm sure there would
be various wishes.</i>

00:12:40.051 --> 00:12:42.679
<i>But, I...</i>

00:12:47.558 --> 00:12:49.227
Hey, listen to this!

00:12:49.227 --> 00:12:51.604
We've got a transfer student
coming today!

00:12:51.604 --> 00:12:54.148
And I hear she's super cute!

00:12:54.148 --> 00:12:55.066
For real?

00:12:55.316 --> 00:12:57.527
Our class is full of uggos too. Score!

00:12:57.527 --> 00:12:59.195
It's my dream come true!

00:13:01.072 --> 00:13:02.782
<i>It's got nothing to do with me.</i>

00:13:04.867 --> 00:13:08.079
Hey, we're starting. Take your seats.

00:13:09.122 --> 00:13:11.624
We'll start by introducing the
new transfer student.

00:13:11.958 --> 00:13:12.834
Enter.

00:13:21.884 --> 00:13:25.388
Nice to meet you. I'm Kurenai Rin.

00:13:29.183 --> 00:13:31.060
I hope you'll be kind to me.

00:13:32.145 --> 00:13:33.021
She-

00:13:34.564 --> 00:13:35.773
<i>She's cute...</i>

00:13:44.991 --> 00:13:46.826
Man...

00:13:47.577 --> 00:13:50.329
<i>I can't believe we got
a girl on that level.</i>

00:13:53.458 --> 00:13:56.669
<i>I think I might be looking forward
to school tomorrow.</i>

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:01.174
Hey, excuse me. But could I ask a favor?

00:14:02.341 --> 00:14:05.553
Um, you're in my class, right?

00:14:06.429 --> 00:14:07.805
Huh? Oh...

00:14:09.891 --> 00:14:12.226
You don't remember me?

00:14:12.977 --> 00:14:15.229
<i>There's no way I wouldn't
remember you!</i>

00:14:15.688 --> 00:14:18.483
<i>Did she actually follow me?</i>

00:14:19.525 --> 00:14:20.735
Um...

00:14:21.194 --> 00:14:23.029
Uh, what?

00:14:23.988 --> 00:14:26.991
Yesterday, I moved to the floor above.

00:14:26.991 --> 00:14:29.285
But my key broke,
and I don't know what to do.

00:14:29.285 --> 00:14:30.119
Your key?

00:14:30.411 --> 00:14:32.622
I don't have a phone, either...

00:14:35.792 --> 00:14:39.170
Um... Could you call a locksmith for me?

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:40.630
<i>Her key?</i>

00:14:41.631 --> 00:14:43.424
<i>Of course...</i>

00:14:43.966 --> 00:14:45.927
<i>Of course she isn't after me.</i>

00:14:46.719 --> 00:14:49.764
Yeah... Sure, hold on a moment.

00:14:51.849 --> 00:14:55.186
<i>Oh well. At least I got a
chance to talk to her.</i>

00:14:55.686 --> 00:14:56.604
Thank you.

00:14:57.105 --> 00:14:58.898
This is a big help.

00:15:04.195 --> 00:15:05.363
Just kidding!

00:15:18.376 --> 00:15:19.585
Where am I?

00:15:26.342 --> 00:15:27.802
Eiji...

00:15:29.512 --> 00:15:32.056
Hoshimiya Eiji...

00:15:36.435 --> 00:15:39.480
Hoshimiya Eiji... Hoshimiya Eiji...

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:45.820
Hoshimiya Eiji... Hoshimiya Eiji...
Hoshimiya Eiji...

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:51.325
Order who destroyed the world,
Hoshimiya Eiji.

00:15:51.659 --> 00:15:54.537
Huh? Wh-What's going on?

00:16:01.169 --> 00:16:03.254
You see, my parents...

00:16:03.254 --> 00:16:05.965
They died during the Great
Destruction, ten years ago.

00:16:06.924 --> 00:16:09.510
So I wanted revenge on you.

00:16:09.886 --> 00:16:12.138
And I wanted you to know that

00:16:12.555 --> 00:16:14.098
before I killed you!

00:16:15.975 --> 00:16:18.603
My mother burned to death in that fire.

00:16:18.603 --> 00:16:22.106
My father suffocated in the smoke,
trying to save her.

00:16:23.024 --> 00:16:25.943
But finally, I can have my revenge...

00:16:28.696 --> 00:16:29.947
Die!

00:16:30.239 --> 00:16:31.240
Wait!

00:16:34.202 --> 00:16:36.954
That was an accident!
It wasn't deliberate!

00:16:58.267 --> 00:16:59.644
I'm glad you came.

00:17:00.394 --> 00:17:02.438
But this is farewell.

00:17:05.733 --> 00:17:06.567
A helicopter!

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:21.332
H-Huh?

00:17:22.208 --> 00:17:23.251
Inn:

00:17:23.251 --> 00:17:24.835
Sir.

00:17:25.461 --> 00:17:27.838
Have you decided on your order?

00:17:28.297 --> 00:17:29.340
Order?

00:17:29.674 --> 00:17:32.218
Yes, your Order.

00:17:32.593 --> 00:17:34.345
Your wish.

00:17:34.762 --> 00:17:36.138
My Wish?

00:17:44.313 --> 00:17:46.107
Order...

00:17:50.236 --> 00:17:51.237
I'm...

00:17:53.572 --> 00:17:56.826
...not a loose woman who
wags her tail for men!

00:18:02.707 --> 00:18:04.834
Order!

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:19.140
Order!

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:21.434
I am begging you, please retreat!

00:18:21.434 --> 00:18:23.811
Eiji-sama! Eiji-sama!

00:18:25.396 --> 00:18:26.355
<i>Effvsama'.!</i>

00:18:27.606 --> 00:18:28.774
Eiji.

00:18:44.498 --> 00:18:47.126
I used to be a cemetery keeper.

00:18:47.626 --> 00:18:53.215
This Rock God is made from gravestones
of those who died hating you.

00:18:53.924 --> 00:18:57.470
My wish was to put their
resentment to rest!

00:19:00.931 --> 00:19:04.101
How dare you kill my child?

00:19:04.643 --> 00:19:08.606
<i>I'm this hated?</i>

00:19:09.315 --> 00:19:11.400
It's your own fault!

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:37.593
Kanmon Tunnel

00:19:47.311 --> 00:19:50.231
Join our side, Eiji.

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:55.361
If you join me, you'll be
with Sena forever.

00:20:11.627 --> 00:20:12.670
Order!

00:20:17.425 --> 00:20:19.176
Order!

00:20:21.262 --> 00:20:22.513
Eiji.

00:20:26.058 --> 00:20:26.934
Eiji.

00:20:27.268 --> 00:20:28.436
Eiji.

00:20:28.686 --> 00:20:29.937
Eiji-sama.

00:20:30.354 --> 00:20:31.439
Eiji.

00:20:31.856 --> 00:20:32.940
Eiji!

00:20:33.732 --> 00:20:35.526
Hoshimiya Eiji!

00:20:49.248 --> 00:20:50.040
Wait!

00:21:19.612 --> 00:21:21.822
<i>I</i> see. I've remembered.

00:21:22.656 --> 00:21:24.408
<i>I'm Hoshimiya Eiji.</i>

00:21:25.201 --> 00:21:28.579
<i>I destroy the world, and conquer it.</i>

00:21:29.205 --> 00:21:32.166
Next, it's your turn, Eiji.

00:21:32.625 --> 00:21:33.417
Daisy.

00:21:34.084 --> 00:21:36.921
It looks like you've finally remembered.

00:21:37.379 --> 00:21:39.006
Now, Eiji.

